==Strategy==
Wait for a bit, then send out [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] followed by meatshields. Your Octo should stay alive in time for your 2nd iCat to perma-freeze the Berserkory. After that, just meatshield and do damage until Berserkory dies. After that, you can deal with the Jones pretty easily. Use Area Attackers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly dispose of their HP. Do not use Single Attack cats, or else the Joneses will un-sync and you won't have a good time.

If one happens to own [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], Berserkory can be used as a stepping stone to snipe the 3 Spacefish Jones present on the stage, dealing immense chip damage.

==Trivia==
*The Bloody Wharf's name may hint at [[Berserkory]], whose axe is bloody.

